 2 numbers is 10 \u00d7 9 = 90.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 2 identical letters and 2 numbers is 26 \u00d7 90 = 2340.\n\nWe need to consider all the cases where the letters are not distinct.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 2 identical letters is 26 \u00d7 1 = 26.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 2 numbers is 10 \u00d7 9 = 90.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 2 identical letters and 2 numbers is 26 \u00d7 90 = 2340.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 3 identical letters is 26 \u00d7 1 = 26.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 2 numbers is 10 \u00d7 9 = 90.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 3 identical letters and 2 numbers is 26 \u00d7 90 = 2340.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 4 identical letters is 26 \u00d7 1 = 26.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 2 numbers is 10 \u00d7 9 = 90.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 4 identical letters and 2 numbers is 26 \u00d7 90 = 2340.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 5 identical letters is 26 \u00d7 1 = 26.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 2 numbers is 10 \u00d7 9 = 90.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 5 identical letters and 2 numbers is 26 \u00d7 90 = 2340.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 6 identical letters is 26 \u00d7 1 = 26.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 2 numbers is 10 \u00d7 9 = 90.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 6 identical letters and 2 numbers is 26 \u00d7 90 = 2340.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 7 identical letters is 26 \u00d7 1 = 26.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 2 numbers is 10 \u00d7 9 = 90.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 7 identical letters and 2 numbers is 26 \u00d7 90 = 2340.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 8 identical letters is 26 \u00d7 1 = 26.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 2 numbers is 10 \u00d7 9 = 90.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 8 identical letters and 2 numbers is 26 \u00d7 90 = 2340.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 9 identical letters is 26 \u00d7 1 = 26.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 2 numbers is 10 \u00d7 9 = 90.\n\nThe number of ways to choose 9 identical letters and 2 numbers is 26 \u00d7 90 = 234